{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Sinister Outbreak \u2013 You woke up in a nightmare. Now fight your way out.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a dark, deserted laboratory... and it's far too quiet. There's no memory of what happened \u2014 just blood on the walls and the sound of something approaching. Something that is no longer alive.<br>Welcome to <strong>Sinister Outbreak</strong>, an action-packed game set in a chilling atmosphere of horror and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udddf\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>Survive the unexpected</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dark corridors and abandoned rooms, where every corner may hide unspeakable horrors. Armed only with what you can find, you\u2019ll face brutal zombies and out-of-control experiments as you search for answers \u2014 and a way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2b <strong>Intense action with a touch of horror</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blending combat with moments of pure tension, <i>Sinister Outbreak</i> puts your reflexes to the test. Manage your ammo, solve puzzles, and try to make it out alive. Not everything can be faced head-on.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3877690?t=1755391705","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3877690?t=1755391705","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877690/322c274c1a78cbf6adfb4d95b61c63230d2dd42c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755391705","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877690/322c274c1a78cbf6adfb4d95b61c63230d2dd42c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755391705","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Sinister Outbreak \u2013 You woke up in a nightmare. Now fight your way out.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a dark, deserted laboratory... and it's far too quiet. There's no memory of what happened \u2014 just blood on the walls and the sound of something approaching. Something that is no longer alive.<br>Welcome to <strong>Sinister Outbreak</strong>, an action-packed game set in a chilling atmosphere of horror and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udddf\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>Survive the unexpected</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dark corridors and abandoned rooms, where every corner may hide unspeakable horrors. Armed only with what you can find, you\u2019ll face brutal zombies and out-of-control experiments as you search for answers \u2014 and a way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2b <strong>Intense action with a touch of horror</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blending combat with moments of pure tension, <i>Sinister Outbreak</i> puts your reflexes to the test. Manage your ammo, solve puzzles, and try to make it out alive. Not everything can be faced head-on.</p>","developers":["Clovek Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877690/6d02047fb7acfc0c5287dad4c5e41a35ae5c65c4/header.jpg?t=1755391705","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Sinister Outbreak","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 de 64 bits or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 8400 or AMD Ryzen 5 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 1060 / AMD Radeon RX 590<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> DirectX 11 or 12-compatible graphics card For best results, high-end hardware is recommended. For example, to take advantage of Nanite, Virtual Shadow Maps, and Lumen, an NVIDIA GTX 1080 or AMD VEGA 64 graphics card or higher is recommended.</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 de 64 bits or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7 8700 or AMD Ryzen 5 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce RTX 2060 / AMD Radeon RX 6900 XT<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> DirectX 11 or 12-compatible graphics card For best results, high-end hardware is recommended. For example, to take advantage of Nanite, Virtual Shadow Maps, and Lumen, an NVIDIA GTX 1080 or AMD VEGA 64 graphics card or higher is recommended.</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Clovek Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Medo","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"5 Sep, 2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877690/fd0316ee797a1d2d69421202aba3ab3ec557ed66/ss_fd0316ee797a1d2d69421202aba3ab3ec557ed66.1920x1080.jpg?t=1755391705","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877690/fd0316ee797a1d2d69421202aba3ab3ec557ed66/ss_fd0316ee797a1d2d69421202aba3ab3ec557ed66.600x338.jpg?t=1755391705"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/